{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_024ann0314_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_024ann0314_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6da873f1da7ce114fbff5f95c6f88dd5217053630c5d685e9686a4493f82599d", "ja": "お疲れさま、杏奈。\n動きやすさとか、衣装に問題は無いか？", "zh": "辛苦了，杏奈。\n活动起来方便吗？服装有没有什么问题？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
